  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "This release introduces significant new telemetry capabilities and improvements to the actor command palette.\n\n**New Commands**\n\n* `actor telemetry` - Monitor live actor activity and detect potential memory leaks by tracking actor creation, termination, and lifecycle events in real-time. Requires actor telemetry to be enabled via HOCON configuration. See [PR #764](https://github.com/petabridge/petabridge.cmd/pull/764) for details.\n\n**Improvements**\n\n* Enhanced `actor alive` command with clearer error messaging when telemetry is disabled, including the exact HOCON configuration needed and link to documentation. See [PR #765](https://github.com/petabridge/petabridge.cmd/pull/765).\n* Improved `actor alive` command documentation with comprehensive examples and configuration guides for all setup methods (HOCON, Akka.Hosting, Classic API). See [PR #766](https://github.com/petabridge/petabridge.cmd/pull/766).\n\n**Bug Fixes**\n\n* Fixed broken download links in documentation. See [PR #763](https://github.com/petabridge/petabridge.cmd/pull/763).",
